@startuml
[*] --> MonitoringInventory
MonitoringInventory --> UpdatingInventory : on item added/removed
UpdatingInventory --> MonitoringInventory : after update
MonitoringInventory --> GeneratingReport : on request
GeneratingReport --> MonitoringInventory : after generation
MonitoringInventory --> ViewingDetails : on item click
ViewingDetails --> MonitoringInventory : after viewing
MonitoringInventory --> SearchingItems : on search
SearchingItems --> MonitoringInventory : after search
MonitoringInventory --> AlertingLowStock : when stock low
AlertingLowStock --> MonitoringInventory : after alert
MonitoringInventory --> [*]
@enduml
